<lb n="21"/>wol ermelten, meinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jhenig</unclear> so jhnen, ge-
